; Aria's CO theme (BH2 Campaign: the Orange Star CO who is M25's final opponent): D minor, 130 bpm, a 4-bar intro and a 40-bar loop (74 s). A final-battle theme: strings carry a chromatic, menacing hook over a half-time stomp and timpani, then lift to a heroic line with the horn; a development takes the same motif through G and F, and the return has the horn throughout. Strings A.48, horn A.111, pad A.26, fuzz bass A.97 with the BH synth bass A.52 under it, kit A.120 (no hats), timpani A.47.
; Original notes; AW2's own voices; no rom lines.
song aria
tempo 130
meter 4/4
reverb 173
priority 0

inst str = A.48 shift=0
inst horn = A.111 shift=-12
inst fz = A.97 shift=24
inst kit = A.120
inst timp = A.47 shift=24
inst pad = A.26 shift=0
inst sb = A.52 shift=0

